sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User Browser
    participant UI as React UI (Home.jsx)
    participant API as Axios Client (api.js)
    participant Flask as Flask Controller (app.py)
    participant Prep as Preprocessor (preprocess.py)
    participant Scaler as StandardScaler (scaler.joblib)
    participant Model as PyTorch IrisNet (nn_model.py)
    participant Vis as Visualizer Engine (analysis.py)

    Note over User, Model: Workflow 1: Single Sample Prediction Request
    User->>UI: Enters features [5.1, 3.5, 1.4, 0.2] & clicks "Classify"
    UI->>API: predict({sepal_length: 5.1, sepal_width: 3.5, ...})
    API->>Flask: POST /api/predict (JSON Payload)
    Flask->>Prep: validate_features(data)
    Prep-->>Flask: (features_list, None)
    Flask->>Scaler: scaler.transform(X)
    Scaler-->>Flask: X_scaled (numpy.ndarray)
    Flask->>Model: torch.from_numpy(X_scaled) -> model(tensor)
    Model-->>Flask: raw logits (shape: [1, 3])
    Flask->>Model: get_probabilities(logits)
    Model-->>Flask: softmax probabilities [0.993, 0.005, 0.002]
    Flask-->>API: HTTP 200 OK (predicted_class: "setosa", confidence: 0.993, probabilities)
    API-->>UI: Response Promise Resolved
    UI-->>User: Renders ClassBadge("setosa", 99.3%) & Probability Bars

    Note over User, Vis: Workflow 2: Test Set Evaluation & Report Generation
    User->>UI: Uploads test CSV or clicks "Load 30-Sample Test Set"
    UI->>API: evaluateTestSet(formDataOrJson)
    API->>Flask: POST /api/evaluate-testset
    Flask->>Scaler: scaler.transform(X_batch)
    Scaler-->>Flask: X_batch_scaled
    Flask->>Model: model(torch.tensor(X_batch_scaled))
    Model-->>Flask: batch_probs
    Flask->>Flask: Compute accuracy, precision, recall, f1-score & confusion matrix
    Flask->>Vis: _make_confusion_matrix_chart(cm_data, class_names)
    Vis->>Vis: plt.subplots(dark_background), sns.heatmap()
    Vis->>Vis: io.BytesIO() -> base64.b64encode()
    Vis-->>Flask: base64_image_string
    Flask-->>API: HTTP 200 OK (accuracy: 1.0, report: "...", cm_chart: base64)
    API-->>UI: Response Promise Resolved
    UI-->>User: Renders MetricsTable, Confusion Matrix Chart & Sample Results Table
